25	 *   <li>If the request did not set {@code sharesHousehold} true, it is rejected with a 409.</li>
26	 *   <li>If it set {@code sharesHousehold} true, the join is allowed and a stable shared
27	 *       {@code householdId} — derived from the canonical last name and address, so every
28	 *       member of the household derives the same value — is stamped onto the existing
29	 *       members and published for {@link AssignOwnerHousehold} to stamp onto the new owner.</li>
30	 * </ul>
